- Allowed labels on different fleets to have the same name. A label's name must be unique among the labels a fleet can see (its own labels and global labels), so a global label can't share a name with any fleet's label.
- Removed the delete label by name API endpoint (`DELETE /api/v1/fleet/labels/:name`). Use delete label by ID (`DELETE /api/v1/fleet/labels/id/:id`) instead. `fleetctl gitops` and `fleetctl delete` delete labels by ID.
